    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d84">

                <pb facs="0085" n="79" sameAs="frus:frus1942v02/pg79"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.60D/78: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Finland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schoenfeld</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Helsinki</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-08-31T12:00:00+03:00">August 31,
                            1942—noon.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 31—8:17 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>734. Former Estonian Minister Varma told me last night in confidence that this
                    Legation and especially our Military Attaché are now kept under regular
                    surveillance by Finnish authorities including stationing of official
                    photographer in nearby houses to record all visitors.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schoenfeld</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
